      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E004",
      "material_id": "2603.18620.txt",
      "sha256": "836565cb9348e46743920165d8c96032a6dd87bf1fc2ff618f13d6a3e5f86258",
      "locator": "§3.3",
      "quote": "This reduces the problem to a contextual bandit and avoids the long-horizon credit-assignment difficulty while\nstill capturing the core challenge of learning to improve instructions from feedback.",
      "support_explanation": "多步转单步近似非等价",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E005",
      "material_id": "2603.18620.txt",
      "sha256": "836565cb9348e46743920165d8c96032a6dd87bf1fc2ff618f13d6a3e5f86258",
      "locator": "§3.3 Eq8–9",
      "quote": "the same gradient estimates whenever a learned baseline is used. Rather than using a value model or group-based normalization\nas the baseline, we can bypass baseline estimation entirely:",
      "support_explanation": "普通baseline吸收delta；关键不用学习baseline",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
