      "quote": "It is, however, a control variate that cancels prompt-specific offsets.",
      "support_explanation": "前编辑分数controlvariate",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E007",
      "material_id": "2603.18620.txt",
