      "locator": "§4.2",
      "quote": "On BIRD, LSE surpasses GEPA by 4.5% (67.3% vs. 62.8%) and TextGrad by 4.2% (67.3% vs. 63.1%).",
      "support_explanation": "作者主结果",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E008",
