      "locator": "Appendix A",
      "quote": "At each round, a batch of 10 problems is sampled with replacement and presented to the action model. The random seed is fixed so that all methods observe the same sequence of problem batches.",
      "support_explanation": "同顺序固定单种子",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E011",
      "material_id": "2603.18620.txt",
      "sha256": "836565cb9348e46743920165d8c96032a6dd87bf1fc2ff618f13d6a3e5f86258",
      "locator": "Appendix A",
      "quote": "We train a separate self-evolving policy for each task domain (Text-to-SQL and QA) using evolutions trajectories generated from the corresponding training set. For each domain, we run 200 data-generation runs, each containing 20 rounds of evolution, yielding approximately 4,000 tree nodes to sample from during RL training.",
      "support_explanation": "分别领域训练与数据成本规模",
      "kind": "author_report"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "E012",
      "material_id": "2603.18620.txt",
